1 NOTE Hans and Kristie first lived on a farm 2 miles from Cambridge in Dane County, Wisconsin.  About 1870, they moved to Dover twonship in Buffalo County, Wisconsin.  Nils helped built the Liberty Prairie Church in Deerfeild as a helpe
2 CONC r with the laying of the foundation.  At Dover he was one of the founders of the Evanger congregation and the congregation was named after him. The church has (at times?) been called the Rekvekirken.
