1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Burial record (27-03-1730; Tarjei is claimed to be 70 years old at death):'''
2 CONT Mo kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-286/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1724-1748, s. 10. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061214340070
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (23-03-1730; Tarjei Gunnarsen had died, and the heirs are listed as the widow, Gro Trondsdatter, and their 4 children: Olav Tarjeisen, 20 years old; Gunnar Tarjeisen, 16 years old; Jon Tarjeisen, 10 years old; an
2 CONC d Jorunn Tarjeisdatter, 27 years old; as well as one daughter with his first wife, namely Astrid Tarjeisdatter, married to Kjetil Kjetilstveit):'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his I wife (23-05-1694; Birgit Gjermundsdatter had died and the heirs are listed as the widower, Tarjei Gunnarsen, and their daughter, Astrid Tarjeisdatter, 1½ years old):'''
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/H/Ha/Haa/L0001: Skifteprotokoll, 1689-1697, s. 65b-66a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090119670422
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his father (11-03-1689; Gunnar Tarjeisen had died, and Tarjei Gunnarsen is listed among the heirs, as the first among two sons):'''
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/H/Ha/Haa/L0001: Skifteprotokoll, 1689-1697, s. 0b-1a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090119670355
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his father-n-law (09-04-1709; Trond Sondresen had died, and Gro Trondsdatter, married to Tarjei Døli, is listed among the heirs, as the second of four daughters):'''
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/H/Ha/Haa/L0003: Skifteprotokoll, 1703-1723, s. 71b-72a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090119670673
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/2162aa7fe2472f248c693123c455a141?page=41 Steinar Marvik, 1989, "Mo bygdebok, Gard og ætt, Bind 2, Skafså sokn" (Døli, Gnr. 46, 13. Tarjei, p. 38)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/8729a0f8b886f635b9da2ac1f48e7672?page=318 Steinar Marvik, 1989, "Mo bygdebok, Gard og ætt, Bind 1, Mo sokn" (Skredtveit, Gnr. 20, 7. Trond, pp. 315-316)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/2162aa7fe2472f248c693123c455a141?page=40 Steinar Marvik, 1989, "Mo bygdebok, Gard og ætt, Bind 2, Skafså sokn" (Døli, Gnr. 46, 10. Gunnar & 11 Jorunn, pp. 37-38)]
2 CONT ----
