1 NAME Hermund Eriksen /Hauge/
2 GIVN Hermund Eriksen
2 SURN Hauge
2 _MARNM Moen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1614
2 PLAC Hauge, Luster, Sogn & Fjordane, Norway 
2 ADDR
