2 CONC (11 Des ?) * BURIAL: (Eide Flahammer/Fladhammer)  Father: Giert Christophersøn MORGENSTIERNE Mother: Birgitte Christophersdatter GLAD  Family 1 : Birgitte ANDERSDATTER  * MARRIAGE: 1653  1.  Vilchen Christophersøn MORGENSTIERNE  F
2 CONC amily 2 : Birgitte Ludvigsdatter MUNTHE  * MARRIAGE: 1657  1. +Ludvig Christopherssøn MUNTHE 2. +Otto Christopherssøn MUNTHE 3. +Birgitte Christophersdatter MUNTHE 4.  Elisabeth Christophersdatter MUNTHE 5. +Ingeborg MUNTHE 6.  Ge
2 CONC rhard Christopherssøn MUNTHE 7. +Abel Catharina MUNTHE
