2 CONC . 1820, g. 1861 m. Marta Brynjulvsdr. Vaete, farmer at Vaete and he did a lot of brass work, Torstein f. 1822, storekeeper in Alesund, Gjertrud. 1803, g. 1821 m. Torgeir Larsson Seim, America, Marta f. 1806, g. 1842 m. Viking Viki
2 CONC ngson Repal, Anna f. 1811, g. 1840 m. Lars Gudleikson Hovda, Brita f. 1815, g. 1842 m. widower Knut Gusskalkson Eide.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kolbein Johannessen f. 1798 was g. 1822 m. Sigvor Velomsdr. Berge and died in 1876. She was f. 1800 and died in 1892.''' He is recorded as a postal carrier when he was married and assumed the farm in 1828. Kolbein was his own c
