1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Kjersti Johannesdatter Kvilekval''' was born on November 8, 1835 in Grevle, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-79502734 Johannes Knutson Raudstad Lydvo (Grevle)] and [https://www.geni.com/pr
2 CONC ofile-79502735 Ingebjørg Mattisdatter Raustad (Mølster)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kjersti married [https://www.geni.com/profile-121933122 Anders Knutson Kvilekval (Århus)] in 1863 in Vossevangen, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-70037502 Anna Ander
2 CONC sdatter Kvilekvål]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-118245376 Knut Anderssen Kvilekval]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626272701 Knut A d.y. Kvilekvål]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626272539 Ragnhild A Kvilekvål (Kvilekval)]; 
2 CONC [https://www.geni.com/profile-34622089928 Lars A Kvilekval]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-32951235293 Ingebjørg Andersdatter Mykkeltveit (Kvilekval)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-21554733293 Johannes A Kvilekval]; [https://www.
2 CONC geni.com/profile-121930152 Berta Andersdotter Rongen (Kvilekvål)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 15, 1920 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway and was buried on March 25, 1920 there. 
2 CONT ----
