1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''For overview of Tveite/Ø.Vinje/Gjerde connections, consult Lyngvær’s Voss Bygdebok, Ættebok for Vossestrand, Tveite Hb, farm number 18, page 200, Ø.Vinje farm number 18 page 221 and, in Kindem’s Vossaboki II, Gjerde, page 319 a
2 CONC s well as Bruk 5, page 322 and following.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Tveite HB'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''18.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kolbein Olson ytre Sundve'''  28e  1668-1733<br/>
2 CONT g. m.  '''Marta  Halsteinsdtr.'''<br/>
2 CONT Budde  fyrst   på  Hole.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT a.  '''Brita''' 1696		g. 1719 m. em.  Johannes  Styrkson  Rue<br/>
2 CONT 				Rue og Berge i Vestbygdi, Voss<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT b.  '''Steinvor''' 1701	g. 1725 m. Johannes  Larsson  Øvre  Vinje<br/>
2 CONT 				Berge  i  Vestbygdi,  Voss<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT c.  Johannes 1707	Herheim 30<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note:  Johannes  Larsson  Øvre  Vinje  is  also  known  as  Johannes  Larsson  Berge.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Øvre Vinje'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''30.'''<br/>
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lars Johannesson Seve,''' Voss  1658<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT g. m. '''Brita Jonsdtr. Dalen,''' Folkedal, Granvin  1701<br/>
2 CONT g. 1705 m. '''Guro Gusskalksdtr. Eide,''' Voss 1685-1764<br/>
2 CONT g. II m. Øvre Vinje 34<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars hadde fyrst gard pa Gjerde, Voss. Brita var dotter til lensmannen Jon Oddmundson Dalen i Granvin, av Rustungaetten.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT a. Marta 1686 - Herheim 24 og 26<br/>
2 CONT b. Ingebjorg 1688 - Midtun 10 og 12<br/>
2 CONT c. Dordi 1691 - Gavle 24<br/>
2 CONT d. Kristi 1693 - g. 1717 m.  Anders Nilsson Himle, g. 1741 m.  Jon Larsson Hemre, ovre Himle, Voss<br/>
2 CONT e. Anna 1695 - g. 1724 m. Gitle Knutson Skutle, g. 1738 m. Dave Sjurson, Midt-Skutle, Voss<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''f. Johannes 1697 - g. 1725 m. Steinvor Kolbeinsdtr., Tveite Hb, Berge i Vestbygdi, Voss'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT g. Torbjom 1700 - Lund 20<br/>
2 CONT h. Ingebjorg 1706 -<br/>
2 CONT i. Brita 1708 -<br/>
2 CONT j. Kari 1710 -<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gjerde'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT 319 Gjerde.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT The Land Commission had in 1661 listed: Assessment 6 laup 6 mark. This 1 laup 1 pund 6 mark belonged to the Finne properties and 2 laup 12 mark to The Apostle properties.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johannes Seve owned 1 laup 3 mark and Klas Miltzow 1 laup 21 mark.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT The census of 1701 had as primogeniture owner Knut Arnbjornson f. 1634 and as tenant Anders Eirikson f. 1664.  As his sons, were recorded Johannes Sjurson f. 1689 and Sverkve Andersson f. 1695.  '''Sverkve, who died unmarried in 1
2 CONC 774, was the half-brother of Johannes Sverkveson, discussed at Bruk 5.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ……………..<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ''The individual bruks.''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ……………<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bruk 5.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ……………<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT 322 Gjerde.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bruk 5.'''  Gjerde.  '''Johannes Sverkveson, tenant at Seve in the middle of the 1600’s, owned 2 laup 1 pund in Gjerde. In a primogeniture case in 1763 at Gjerde it came to light that Johannes had two sons: Sverkve J. Gjerde an
2 CONC d Lars Johannessen Seve.''' Sverkve got 1 laup 1 pund in Gjerde. His descendants have since lived there and<br/>
2 CONT <br/>323 Gjerde.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT lived there still in 1763. He was grandfather (father’s father) to Kristi Johannesdr.’s mother, who was married to Anders Halleson Gjerde. See about them below. '''Lars J. Seve or Vinjo got 1 laup in Gjerde.''' This property was t
2 CONC he one about which they had a lawsuit. Lars lived at Gjerde until he got title on the land. '''His son, Johannes L. Berge, who was Brita’s father, traded for 1 laup in Berge and leased 1 laup in Gjerde,''' which Erling Rognaldson 
2 CONC got in 1730. He sold to Velom Nilsson Langeland in 1732, who in 1733 leased 1 laup 6 mark to the named Erling and in 1737 to Knut Olavson. '''[Note from Robert L Hovde:  the above reference to “Lars J Seve or Vinjo….His son, Johan
2 CONC nes L. Berge, who was Brita’s father” is unclear.]'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ………….<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Now we shall go back to the grandson (son’s-son) of the above mentioned  Johannes Sverkveson. He also is named Johannes Sverkveson, was born in 1689, married 1714  m. Brita Jakobsdr. Hoyland and died in 1737. In the church registe
2 CONC r it says that he “had in lain for 13 years without his reason in iron, but died more or less with reason.”  In 1709 Johannes got the deed on 1 laup in Gjerde. He and Brita had three children:  Kristi  f. 1715, Brita f. 1716 and B
2 CONC egga  f. 1720.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ……………<br/>
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
