1 NAME Johannes Bendikson /Fjaerestad/
2 GIVN Johannes Bendikson
2 _MARNM Fjaerestad
2 NICK Bendiksson
2 NICK Fjærestad
2 NICK Fjerstad
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC South Zumbro Lutheran Church Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Salem Corners
3 STAE Minnesota
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 JAN 1814
2 ADDR
3 STAE Sogn og Fjordane
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 NOV 1901
2 ADDR
3 STAE Minnesota
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/134318182/johannes-bendikson-fjaerestad
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Jan. 17, 1814, Vik, Askvoll kommune, Sogn og Fjordane fylke, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:  Nov. 1, 1901, Dodge County, Minnesota, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Bendikson Fjaerestad was born on his parents' farm in Vik, Sogn og Fjordane, the 7th of 11 children. He married Kari Hansdatter Svardal in Norway and they had two children: Anna and Bendik.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes was my grandpa Olai's grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes and family sold their farm and emigrated out of Norway in 1851, to WI. We presume they stayed with his older brother, Erik Bendikson Fjaerestad and family in the Cambridge, WI area, who had come to WI several years earlie
2 CONC r.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dodge County records show that Johannes homesteaded 160 acres in Canisteo Twp., Dodge County, MN in 1856. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son, Bendik got the farm, and Johannes and Kari lived with Bendik until they died.
2 CONT
2 CONT They helped to build South Zumbro Lutheran Church, along with their relatives and fellow Norwegian immigrant neighbors, where Norwegian was the only language spoken until decades after they died. Their farm, located walking distan
2 CONC ce to the church, is beautiful in 2014, not too different than when they owned it. Johannes is my g.g.grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relatives are welcome to contact us: Lsharp@alaska.net 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT *Kari Hansdatter Svardal Fjerstad (1812 - 1889)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *Anna Johannesdatter Fjerstad Johnson (1841 - 1925)*
2 CONT *Bendik Johannesson Fjerstad (1844 - 1922)*
2 CONT *Hans Johanneson Benson Fjerstad (1852 - 1864)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Calculated relationship*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: South Zumbro Lutheran Church Cemetery  Salem Corners Olmsted County Minnesota, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Linda Dallas Sharp Record added: Aug 14, 2014  Find A Grave Memorial# 134318182
2 CONT --------------------
