1 NOTE (from notes by Kathleen Lupcho, Northwood, ND)   Knute was raised near Voss, Norway, and didn't go with his mother and father to Nordland. He stayed with his grandparents.  When he went to Nordland to visit his family, he met and 
2 CONC then married Mathea Olson Ostvoldalen in Norway. Mathea had two brothers, Peter and Andreas Oswald, who lived near Fertile, just south of Northwood in Worth County, IA, and Knute and Mathea moved there also. Albert Hovland joined 
2 CONC their family when they later moved to Lind township, (1882) Northwood, ND, and homesteaded on a farm (7-8-1889) about 5 miles west of Northwood, ND. Mathea died in May, 1898. Later, Knute married a working girl from Norway named S
2 CONC ena. They moved to the town of Northwood, ND and lived in the north part of town. After selling that property, they both moved to Northwood Old People's Home where both died at different times of pneumonia.
1 NOTE (from notes by Kathleen Lupcho, Northwood, ND)   Knute was raised near Voss, Norway, and didn't go with his mother and father to Nordland. He stayed with his grandparents.  When he went to Nordland to visit his family, he met and 
