1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Probate record (10-03-1691; Torbjørg Bjørnsdatter had died, and the heirs were listed as the widower, Olav Bjørgulvsen, and their five children: Gunnulv Olavsen; Bjørgulv Olavsen; Gunvor Olavsdatter, married to 
2 CONC Gunnar Floten; Margit Olavsdatter; and Torbjørg Olavsdatter):'''
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/H/Ha/Haa/L0001: Skifteprotokoll, 1689-1697, s. 27b-28a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090119670382
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record of her mother (16-09-1686; Guri Såvisdatter was still alive, but surrendered the estate to her children, among them Torbjørg Bjørnsdatter, who was the first of two daughters with her first husband):'''
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/F/Fa/L0012: Tingbok, 1686, s. 23. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rg20090714610424
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her husband (29-11-1707; Olav Bjørgulvsen had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Hege Halvorsdatter, their 3 children: Knut Olavsen; Elling Olavsen; and Sigrid Olavsdatter; as well as his 4 child
2 CONC ren with his first wife, Torbjørg Bjørnsdatter: Gunnulv Olavsen, who had died, but left one child; Gunvor Olavsdatter, married to Gunnar Bakken; Margit Olavsdatter, married to Peder Dalen; and Torbjørg Olavsdatter, not married):''
2 CONC '
2 CONT Vest-Telemark sorenskriveri, AV/SAKO-A-134/H/Ha/Haa/L0003: Skifteprotokoll, 1703-1723, s. 41b-42a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20090119670643
2 CONT ----
