1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kilde: http://archiver.rootsweb.com/th/read/NOR-VOSSELAG/2005-10/1130812968
2 CONT
2 CONT "From: "Ostermeyer, Michael J." <MJO@quarles.com> 
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject: New member background 
2 CONT
2 CONT Date: Mon, 31 Oct 2005 20:42:48 -0600
2 CONT
2 CONT At Dick Flisrand's suggestion that it's customary for new list members to do so, I attach a little background for the list:
2 CONT
2 CONT My Voss people are from Myrkdalen, tracing back through paternal lineages (at least as I read the Aettebok for Vossestrand) to Boltov indre Sundve (b.circa 1600 d.circa 1645). My great-great grandfather, Sjur Oyelson Nesheim (b.18
2 CONC 31 d.1897, oldest son of Oyel Kolbeinson Nesheim and Kristi Mikkjelsdtr. Ulvund), emigrated from Kvasshaugen at Nesheim in 1853, coming to Clinton Township, Rock County, Wisconsin in the Jefferson Prairie settlement. Sjur lost a w
2 CONC ife (Betsey Isaacs) and two sons (Lewis and Claus) to a cholera outbreak there in the early 1860s, after which he moved on (in 1866) to Primrose Township, Dane County, Wisconsin. There he remarried, wedding my great-great grandmot
2 CONC her, Ingeborg Oddmunsdtr. Helgeland (b.1858 d.1936), who had come from Myrkdalen in 1864 with her parents Oddmund Knutson Helgeland and Guri Andersdtr. Overland.
2 CONT
2 CONT If a helpful bit of information could fall from the sky for me, it would be the family and immigration information on Sjur's first wife (Betsey Isaacs) or information on their date and place of marriage, as well as some notion of 
2 CONC where she and her two little boys might be buried. I visited Bergen Corner this summer and Jefferson Prairie cemeteries both east (where I understood there was a memorial to cholera victims, but didn't find it) and west (where I f
2 CONC ound one or two families named Isaacs), but had no luck.
2 CONT
2 CONT ____________________________ 
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael J. Ostermeyer 
2 CONT
2 CONT Quarles & Brady LLP 
2 CONT
2 CONT 411 East Wisconsin Avenue 
2 CONT
2 CONT Milwaukee, Wisconsin 53202 
2 CONT
2 CONT Direct Dial: 414.277.5521 
2 CONT
2 CONT Direct Fax: 414.978.8956 
2 CONT
2 CONT E-mail: mjo@quarles.com"
