1 NOTE (from "History of Emigration from Voss", 1930, K. A. Rene, Page 483) Sjur moved from Jefferson Prairie to Primrose after his (first) wife and children died there. . .  He married a second time to Ingeborg Edmunds in 1875, daughter
2 CONC  of Amund (Oddmund Knutson Helgeland) and Guri Fosli, who came to America with her family in 1864 and settled in Primrose (WI).  Sjur bought a farm and was a resident of Primrose until his death. . . (11 children listed)
