0 @N6000000003875782087@ NOTE Kjel had a farm for a time at Løn.  He moved to Giljarhus and then traded from there to Selje.  The suspect birth/marriage dates are as entered in "¡ttebok for Vossestrand", Lyngvær, pp. 171 & 394.
